sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant UAS as UserAccounts-Service
    participant PS as Payments-Service
    participant NS as Notifications-Service
    participant UASDB as UserAccounts-DB
    participant PSDB as Payments-DB
    participant NSDB as Notifications-DB

    Note over C,NSDB: ========== User Registration Flow ==========
    C->>UAS: POST ap1/v1/users/register (Personal + Contact + KYC Details)
    UAS->>UASDB: Create Customer, CIF & Account (Status:PENDING)
    UASDB-->>UAS: Creation Success
    UAS->>NS: POST ap1/notifications/send Send Registration Notification
    NS->>NSDB: Store Notification
    NSDB-->>NS: Stored
    NS-->>UAS: Notification Sent
    UAS-->>C: Registration Success (Customer Number)

    Note over C,NSDB: ========== Status Inquiry Flow ==========
    C->>UAS: GET ap1/v1/users/pending/{customerNumber}
    UAS->>UASDB: Fetch Registration Status
    UASDB-->>UAS: Status Details
    UAS-->>C: Status Response

    Note over C,NSDB: ========== Admin Status Update Flow ==========
    C->>UAS: PUT ap1/v1/users/update
    UAS->>UASDB: Update Customer Status to ACTIVE
    UASDB-->>UAS: Update Success
    UAS->>NS: Send Status Update Notification POST ap1/notifications/send 
    NS->>NSDB: Store Notification
    NSDB-->>NS: Stored
    NS-->>UAS: Notification Sent
    UAS-->>C: Status Update Success Response

    Note over C,NSDB: ========== Payment Flow ==========
    C->>PS: POST ap1/v1/payments/createPayment (FromAccount + ToAccount + Amount)
    PS->>PSDB: Process & Store Payment
    PSDB-->>PS: Payment Stored
    PS->>NS: Send Payment Notification POST ap1/notifications/send 
    NS->>NSDB: Store Notification
    NSDB-->>NS: Stored
    NS-->>PS: Notification Sent
    PS-->>C: Payment Success Response